  "features": [
    "adds Guide as a native project mode",
    "adds Research Investigation, Evidence Review, Analytical Assessment, Decision Case, Systems Mapping, and Publication Preparation templates",
    "supports multiple guided workflow runs within one project",
    "keeps workflow steps, notes, status, and completion explicit and user-controlled",
    "opens the relevant native Workspace mode from each step",
    "preserves blank projects as a first-class path",
    "does not generate hidden findings, infer completion, or authorize decisions",
    "migrates existing schema-11 projects non-destructively to schema 12/project 10.0",
    "retains the canonical Knowledge Library route /knowledge-libraries/"
